    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a738551756bbe4992873e78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我有种必须要现在吃到的拉面，\r\n但那种拉面必须得坐飞机去外地才行。\r\n咱们立刻订机票吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "184fa815119eca5e3e0d49e81ea1465dac0db0e3ad6a23d9aadfe6e3e32ec707",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
