      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迄今为止，\r\n每当她自言自语关于『拉面』的话题时，\r\n总是会发生些不得了的事情。比如说——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcfd73ce2d0277d439a20612f2a36a9ffa348614fde14accebbfbaf31abc5a8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
